    <comp lib="7" loc="(1470,820)" name="Text">
      <a name="font" val="SansSerif bold 22"/>
      <a name="text">Estado actual Condición Próximo estado
FETCH Siempre DECODE
DECODE IsLoad OR IsStore MEM_ADDR
DECODE IsR R_EXEC
DECODE IsBranch BRANCH
DECODE IsJump OR IsJr JUMP
DECODE IsImm IMM_EXEC
DECODE IsSysCall SYSCALL
DECODE Illegal HALT
MEM_ADDR IsLoad MEM_READ
MEM_ADDR IsStore MEM_WRITE
MEM_READ Siempre LOAD_WB
LOAD_WB Siempre FETCH
MEM_WRITE Siempre FETCH
R_EXEC Siempre R_WB
R_WB Siempre FETCH
BRANCH Siempre FETCH
JUMP Siempre FETCH
IMM_EXEC Siempre IMM_WB
IMM_WB Siempre FETCH
SYSCALL SysPrint PRINT
SYSCALL SysExit HALT
SYSCALL Ninguno de los anteriores FETCH
PRINT Siempre FETCH
HALT Siempre HALT</a>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="7" loc="(150,90)" name="Text">
      <a name="font" val="SansSerif plain 12"/>
      <a name="text" val="RELOJ / ESTADO"/>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="7" loc="(1580,100)" name="Text">
      <a name="font" val="SansSerif bold 22"/>
      <a name="text">Estado
IsS0 (0) FETCH
IsS1 (1) DECODE
IsS2 (2) MEM_ADDR
IsS3 (3) MEM_READ
IsS4 (4) LOAD_WB
IsS5 (5) MEM_WRITE
IsS6 (6) R_EXEC
IsS7 (7) R_WB
IsS8 (8) BRANCH
IsS9 (9) JUMP
IsS10 (10) IMM_EXEC
IsS11 (11) IMM_WB
IsS12 (12) SYSCALL
IsS13 (13) PRINT
IsS14 (14) HALT
IsS15 (15) Sin utilizar</a>
    </comp>
